        "text": "This limited, non-contiguous reference class has a base rate near zero but substantial monthly variation: the fetched same-series prints span -0.6% to 0.3%, and the July 2025 analogue was 0.1%. Recent 2026 momentum is weaker, with March through May at -0.6%, -0.5%, and -0.1%."
